  <item>
    <title>Amazon Prime Video'ga AI xarid funksiyasini qo'shdi</title>
    <link>https://ailenta.uz/x/amazon-prime-videoga-ai-xarid-funksiyasini-qoshdi-72208e/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://ailenta.uz/x/amazon-prime-videoga-ai-xarid-funksiyasini-qoshdi-72208e/</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 21:15:57 GMT</pubDate>
    <description>Amazon Prime Video'ga yangi funksiya qo'shdi, bu orqali tomoshabinlar AI yordamida ekrandagi qahramonlar kiygan yoki ishlatgan mahsulotlarni xarid qilishlari mumkin. Bu &quot;binge watching&quot; va &quot;binge shopping&quot;ni birlashtiradi.</description>
