    <title>Qualcomm va Amazon AI infratuzilmasi bo'yicha kelishib oldi</title>
    <link>https://ailenta.uz/x/qualcomm-va-amazon-ai-infratuzilmasi-boyicha-kelishib-oldi-850aed/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://ailenta.uz/x/qualcomm-va-amazon-ai-infratuzilmasi-boyicha-kelishib-oldi-850aed/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 13:35:01 GMT</pubDate>
    <description>Qualcomm kompaniyasi Amazon Web Services uchun sun'iy intellekt infratuzilmasini yaratish maqsadida maxsus chiplar yetkazib berish bo'yicha shartnoma imzoladi. Ushbu kelishuv ortidan Qualcomm aksiyalari narxi 6 foizdan ko'proqqa oshdi.</description>
